{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"It slapped against the windowpane with a resilient rhythm, a warning that the sky was no longer holding its breath. Elias turned from the garden gate just as the first fat drops began to streak the dirt path, heavy and urgent. He didn't run, but his pace quickened, boots churning into the loosening earth. The smell of petrichor hit him in full force before he crossed the threshold, sharp and metallic, mingling with the scent of crushed sage he’d left so brutally exposed to the weather. He pulled the door shut, latching it instantly to keep the chill out, and stood for a moment in the dim entryway, watching the glass fog over as the rain transformed from a skyward threat into a pervasive, resonant drumming that swallowed the silence of the house.","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1792460621,"id":"chatcmpl-18e019703b29c6cc0061","model":"qwen3.8-27b-fp8","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"aien_sampling":{"greedy_tokens":0,"kept":[248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248